# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .gitignore — Cocos Creator 2.4.10 (project "Roy88")
#
# Nguyen tac: TRACK toan bo SOURCE (assets/, settings/, build-templates/,
# tools/, project.json...). Chi ignore thu muc do Cocos Creator SINH RA
# hoac trang thai rieng cua tung may.
#
# Muc dich: `git pull` ve may local la mo duoc ngay bang Cocos Creator.
# => KHONG duoc them bat ky pattern nao cham vao assets/.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ===== Cocos Creator sinh ra (import cache / build output) =====
library/
temp/
build/
.import/
.cache/

# ===== Trang thai rieng cua tung may (layout editor, node tree...) =====
local/

# ===== Node =====
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log

# ===== IDE / Editor =====
.vscode/
.idea/
.cursor/
*.swp
*~

# ===== Log & rac he dieu hanh =====
*.log
console_logger.txt
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
